==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|bohémien||person from [[Bohemia]]}}, from {{m|fr|Bohême||[[Bohemia]]}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An inhabitant of [[Bohemia]], region in the Czech Republic and a former monarchy.
# An [[unconventional]] or [[nonconformist]] [[artist]] or [[writer]].

